efunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104907608", "author": {"steamid": "76561198034790117", "personaname": "EGYPTIAN HIEROGLYPH D053", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/moose13/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 532, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 90, "last_played": 1638599135, "avatar": "2f699ede535e43345c4ee9961569cf00b4492983"}, "language": "english", "review": "Has a lot more features and mechanics than \"Left 4 Dead\" but somehow feels unpolished and watered down compared to that game. With patches and balance tweaks I can see it being amazing.\n\nWeapon selection and mod system is nice, however being unable to remove mods doesn't quite make sense.\nThe regular zombies feel way more clunky than L4D and with lag spikes etc they rubber band badly.\n\nThe special zombies are just bullet sponges and their weak spots are rarely visible while they are attacking you.\n\nThe multiplayer interaction is weird, I have played a bunch of games and only ran into one person who communicated, who used keyboard chat instead of voice and literally no one else said anything the whole time.\n\nEven with cross-play the multiplayer takes far too long to search for games. The round start timer is too long, waiting up to 4 mins for someone to afk pick a card before the shop opens. This game should be fast paced and instead I'm waiting for timers over and over.\n\nNo server browser.", "timestamp_created": 1638314460, "timestamp_updated": 1638401702, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.532467544078826904", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": 