status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/FurbyHimbo/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 24996, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12161, "last_played": 1691860112, "avatar": "ae0c31fe7a967533e596cd6ba5b12e6ac624b7b6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Honestly, there is a lot of RNG. I'm super hopeful that the game will be updated and some things will be corrected. I really enjoy the feel of b4b and I know that there will be longevity to the game. :3 \n\nRegardless, strongly recommend and will continue to keep playing even with 200+ hrs.", "timestamp_created": 1638307626, "timestamp_updated": 1638307626, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104896152", "author": {"steamid": "76561197991345400", "personaname": "nananaBatmaaan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197991345400/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 2836, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2834, "last_played": 1638477031, "avatar": "1124d6a17f2f54127837513e857d94d7d1c1110d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game, easier to coordinate and better with friends unless you stumble upon some talkative players online.\n\nStory mode is exciting to play, the deck building system makes replaying the levels fun. Harder difficulties need good cooperation and experienced players.\n\nSwarm is different, most of the times one team annihilates the other, a balanced, exciting swarm game is very rare..\n\nThe player base right now is angry about all the nerfs and the randomness in enemy cards, but if you like tough games and love L4D this is a very good game\n", "timestamp_created": 1638307289, "timestamp_updated": 1638307289, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104895722", "author": {"steamid": "76561197965420071", "personaname": "nuggethead ~traffic enjoyer~", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dougcarl/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 3300, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1056, "last_played": 1683342812, "avatar": "f79e706468f462d8caa80fc6b10658e4156f1f24"}, "language": "english", "review": "it's not bad", "timestamp_created": 1638307087, "timestamp_updated": 1638307087, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104893962", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011698318", "personaname": "~°ĜĘЯ°~Ĕvǐɭ Ĕvǿ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198011698318/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 5086, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5063, "last_played": 1709644482, "avatar": "0d4cef773227e3a6a6a4e9afff2f05b1f61bcd23"}, "language": "english", "review": "Overall a good idea but excecuted badly. \nIf you don't have a 4 player hardcore team you're often stuck on recruit difficulty and on some evenings veteran can kill your group a good dozen times on a bad day on map 1-2 and thats with 1000hours+ expert L4D veterans. \nRecruit is overall too boring for an evening with friends and veteran is no fun if you don't rush everything you can which is also rather boring quickly.\nAlso you require 1 healer and 1 meele player for med or high difficulty no rush ... is this game actually an RPG?  \nMy advice would be a difficulty between veteran and recruit and rebalance the gamedirector. Spawning a breaker in a narrow corridor + 4 reeker + hord while you have the mere starting equip is just a lost run and you can restart the entire thing because it'll happen a second time again. In general the balancing is \"spawn several more special infected + hords even if 2 players are already down.\" \n\nOverall 2/10 terrible balancing which forces you to rush as much as you can all the time and it feels too much like an RPG.\n", "timestamp_created": 1638306175, "timestamp_updated": 1638306175, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519999980926513672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104891303", "author": {"steamid": "76561198805918244", "personaname": "Nat", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198805918244/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 5864, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3725, "last_played": 1704086103, "avatar": "c7af7a019e26d66873661133f489c3b398297d48"}, "language": "english", "review": "Love, especially with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1638304921, "timestamp_updated": 1638304921, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.558823525905609131", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid"